  charType: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c0929d5203a972646bd8aafa1fdcd9e5, type: 2}
  lineTexts:
  - "You are the one they brought here \u2013 it really is you!"
  - Is what the raccoon said true? That you can't remember anything?
  - I've seen the path you took to get here. I'm keeping an eye on the forest, which
    is a bit of a challenge right now because I've still got to gather and stock
    up on loads of supplies for the winter!
  - Would you mind collecting some specific mushrooms for me? The raccoon said that
    you're an expert at finding them.
